255
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:43,260
This victory is indisputably yours.

256
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:46,660
Too bad for you, I've got heaven's door.

257
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:50,491
The power to make someone into
a book and rewrite them too.

258
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:53,428
Just now, I took the
chance to write in you.

259
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:56,397
But as far as our competition's
concerned, you've won.

260
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:58,580
I concede. Isn't that enough?

261
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:05,520
You were the one who
ultimately pressed the button.

262
00:19:13,320 --> 00:19:14,150
Rohan.

263
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:31,447
I'm not going to look down through this
broken window, to the scene down below.

264
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:36,120
Even if I did, I'm sure I
wouldn't see Yoma at the bottom.

265
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:40,613
He may be clinging to the side
of the building somewhere.

266
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:44,548
I need to get out of
this place immediately.

267
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,780
I need to escape.

268
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:54,200
Though I didn't intend to,
I'd crossed the red line.

269
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:58,260
If I looked out of this window now,

270
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:03,920
if I stuck my head out as if to look
down upon him, he would probably kill me.

271
00:20:05,560 --> 00:20:09,320
The muscles on his back
were in the shape of wings.

272
00:20:10,460 --> 00:20:12,400
The ones above his ankles, too.

273
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:17,140
And when the wind blew through his
hair, I saw them behind his ears.

274
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:20,560
They were a symbol, I'm sure of it.

275
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,675
He's a man possessed.

276
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:24,260
The wings were the sign.

277
00:20:25,460 --> 00:20:28,080
He is possessed by the God of Muscle.

278
00:20:28,440 --> 00:20:30,600
This god has many names.

279
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:33,600
In Greek myth, he is called Hermes.

280
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:38,120
Yoma Hashimoto has turned
into the god Hermes incarnate.

281
00:20:38,500 --> 00:20:40,900
I shouldn't have gone anywhere near him.

282
00:20:41,220 --> 00:20:44,279
I risked my life in our
competition for that remote.

283
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:46,137
That's the truth.

284
00:20:46,220 --> 00:20:50,660
but that still doesn't
mean he'll ever accept it.

285
00:20:51,380 --> 00:20:54,700
I sincerely hope I haven't
brought his wrath down on me.

286
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:58,920
The only thing I can do now is run.

287
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:35,557
I want to know the truth
of life that never melts.

288
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:40,277
To chain a mystic rise, I'm coming!

289
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:45,780
I'm on my way to find eternal reality.

290
00:21:51,340 --> 00:21:56,937
I can feel my heart beating.

291
00:21:57,020 --> 00:22:00,817
I can see my faith.

292
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:03,897
All spinning round?

293
00:22:03,980 --> 00:22:06,860
Beyond the time!

294
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:10,797
Rise up to the sky.

295
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:12,877
Like a butterfly.

296
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:15,597
Show me what's inside.

297
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:18,737
All the sights over the world go.

298
00:22:18,820 --> 00:22:22,437
Shining stars will guide me to

299
00:22:22,520 --> 00:22:25,837
Somewhere high finding the truth?

300
00:22:25,920 --> 00:22:28,560
Beyond the heaven's door.

301
00:22:53,860 --> 00:22:54,690
Thank you.

302
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:17,480
Thank you.
